(7591981, 1223737, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, if I go by order of my vote, this got a 9 and the top score, and a Blue Ribbon. Super creative, took time and effort to put in. Fabulous expression on your son''s face and I bet you all had a blast doing this.  As a family person, photography is more fun when the whole family can be involved and creative, it get''s the children minds working and thinking out of the box, being educational but mostly for teh family time and giggles it can provide and taking something that can easily photographed (such as a landscape) and turned into this.  This is the best of this competition as it did all that.  Congratulations.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-08-13 13:16:24.</i></td>', 'Well, if I go by order of my vote, this got a 9 and the top score, and a Blue Ribbon. Super creative, took time and effort to put in. Fabulous expression on your son''s face and I bet you all had a blast doing this.  As a family person, photography is more fun when the whole family can be involved and creative, it get''s the children minds working and thinking out of the box, being educational but mostly for teh family time and giggles it can provide and taking something that can easily photographed (such as a landscape) and turned into this.  This is the best of this competition as it did all that.  Congratulations.', '2018-08-13 14:11:34.000000', '2018-08-13 14:16:24.000000', 0),
(7591982, 1223808, 128323, '<td valign="top">Way to go Mary Ann!  Beautiful image, congrats on the ribbon!  Go hit squad!</td>', 'Way to go Mary Ann!  Beautiful image, congrats on the ribbon!  Go hit squad!', '2018-08-13 14:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
