(7640915, 1223436, 72708, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and B&amp;W over color in this case. Lack of critical sharpness in the image is not such a problem for me (I get the smoke issue). It''s a moody shot and looks "old". Nice image.</td>', 'I like the composition and B&W over color in this case. Lack of critical sharpness in the image is not such a problem for me (I get the smoke issue). It''s a moody shot and looks "old". Nice image.', '2019-09-08 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 0);
